    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead Humanity is a game that offers an immersive horror experience, taking you to a brutal post-apocalyptic world. This game is told through the eyes of a character who is in a coma after a massive traffic accident. But fate could not have predicted what was about to happen to our character. While our character is in a coma, he captures a moment when a huge epidemic that ravages the world breaks out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569470/extras/4fb8bad07487dbca8cc34baebe5f8023.poster.avif?t=1748449444\" width=400 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569470/extras/4fb8bad07487dbca8cc34baebe5f8023.webm?t=1748449444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569470/extras/4fb8bad07487dbca8cc34baebe5f8023.mp4?t=1748449444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main Features of the Game: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Suspenseful Story:  <br>Players will uncover mysteries and secrets as they become fascinated with the fearful world their characters inhabit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich Graphics and Atmosphere: <br>It offers detailed graphics and atmospheric sound effects to deliver an unforgettable visual experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity and Change Theme: <br>The game will question the limits of human nature and reflect your character's inner battle.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead Humanity is a game that offers an immersive horror experience, taking you to a brutal post-apocalyptic world. This game is told through the eyes of a character who is in a coma after a massive traffic accident. But fate could not have predicted what was about to happen to our character. While our character is in a coma, he captures a moment when a huge epidemic that ravages the world breaks out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569470/extras/4fb8bad07487dbca8cc34baebe5f8023.poster.avif?t=1748449444\" width=400 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569470/extras/4fb8bad07487dbca8cc34baebe5f8023.webm?t=1748449444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569470/extras/4fb8bad07487dbca8cc34baebe5f8023.mp4?t=1748449444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main Features of the Game: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Suspenseful Story:  <br>Players will uncover mysteries and secrets as they become fascinated with the fearful world their characters inhabit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich Graphics and Atmosphere: <br>It offers detailed graphics and atmospheric sound effects to deliver an unforgettable visual experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity and Change Theme: <br>The game will question the limits of human nature and reflect your character's inner battle.</p>",
